110: ## 6. Final Numbers
111: **Binary.** P(4Q26 guide midpoint < LSEG-family 4Q26 mean on 4 Nov) = **0.75**, credible interval **0.62-0.85**.
112: Structure: mixture 0.60 x team-band decomposition (0.800) + 0.25 x market-implied-GBV route (0.683) + 0.15 x wide/structural component (0.722, � sd 2.86%, cushion 1.86%, nights sd 2.2, ADR sd 1.8, drift sd 1.0) = 0.746, rounded to 0.75. P(no 4Q26 dollar guide) = 0.01 is inside the number.
113: 
114: **Guide-surprise object (fine print, not the headline).** P(midpoint < Street mean x (1 - 0.01857)) = **0.51** (base case 0.56; B2-input replication 0.26-0.31). I.e. it is roughly even whether the guide lands below what the Street itself implicitly expects the guide to be.
